[2025-08-01 19:35:37 INF] JobId=3a562570-0177-41b1-8a3f-9810185f1887 QnetTransform.LLMUtils.Interfaces.ILLMInvoker: Response JSON returned from API: {"response":"# Code Migration Summary: EF Core Application to .NET 8.0\n\nThe code shows a migration of an Entity Framework Core application from .NET 6.0 to .NET 8.0. The primary change is the upgrade of the target framework and its dependencies, along with a reorganization of namespaces for better structure and maintainability.\n\n## Key Technical Changes\n\n* **Framework Upgrade**: \n  * Target framework updated from `net6.0` to `net8.0`\n  * EF Core packages upgraded from version 6.0.0 to 8.0.8\n  * Microsoft.Extensions packages upgraded to newer versions (some to 9.0.2)\n\n* **Namespace Restructuring**:\n  * `ApplicationDbContext` moved to `EFCore.Data.Contexts` namespace\n  * `ProductDbContext` moved to `EFCore.DataAccess.Contexts` namespace\n  * Better organization of DB context classes by logical function\n\n* **Class Renaming**:\n  * `ApplicationDbContextFactory` renamed to `ApplicationDbContextFactoryDesignTime`\n  * `Queries` static class renamed to `ProductQueries` for clearer purpose identification\n\n* **Package Management**:\n  * Removed legacy `packages.config` in favor of PackageReference format\n  * Added explicit reference to `EntityFramework` version 6.5.1 \n  * Package references reordered alphabetically in the project file\n\n* **Project Structure**: \n  * Improved solution organization with contexts in dedicated namespaces\n  * Added porting analysis result file indicating successful migration"}.
