[2025-08-01 19:35:41 INF] JobId=3a562570-0177-41b1-8a3f-9810185f1887 QnetTransform.LLMUtils.Interfaces.ILLMInvoker: Response JSON returned from API: {"response":"# Code Migration Summary: EF Core Application to .NET 8.0\n\nThe code migration updates an Entity Framework Core application from .NET 6.0 to .NET 8.0, with comprehensive changes to framework targets, package dependencies, and code organization.\n\n## Key Technical Changes\n\n* **Framework Upgrade**: \n  * Target framework changed from `net6.0` to `net8.0`\n  * EF Core packages upgraded from 6.0.0 to 8.0.8\n  * Microsoft.Extensions packages updated to newer versions (some to 9.0.2)\n\n* **Namespace Restructuring**:\n  * `ApplicationDbContext` relocated to `EFCore.Data.Contexts` namespace\n  * `ProductDbContext` moved to `EFCore.DataAccess.Contexts` namespace\n  * DB context classes organized by logical function\n\n* **Class Renaming**:\n  * `ApplicationDbContextFactory` renamed to `ApplicationDbContextFactoryDesignTime`\n  * `Queries` static class renamed to `ProductQueries`\n\n* **Package Management**:\n  * Replaced legacy `packages.config` with PackageReference format\n  * Added EntityFramework 6.5.1 reference\n  * Package references alphabetically reordered in project file\n\n* **Project Structure**: \n  * Contexts placed in dedicated namespaces for better organization\n  * Added porting analysis result file"}.
